                        "form": "бла́гости"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "f3e14fbc-de68-41c1-915d-6018f42fe0e9",
                        "entry_id": "c82dd0aa-6ae1-316c-8c82-293f3f4530ab",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "prepositional"
                        ],
                        "form": "бла́гостях"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "7822af6d-fc8a-3b08-9973-3fe5e125eba9",
                        "entry_id": "c82dd0aa-6ae1-316c-8c82-293f3f4530ab",
                        "glosses": [
                            "книжн., устар. свойство по значению прилагательного благой; доброта, милосердие"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "937b5dc3-196f-4fcf-9f8c-b7f6c64a2c58",
                                "sense_id": "7822af6d-fc8a-3b08-9973-3fe5e125eba9",
                                "text": "Я имею доверенность к мудрости властителей и спокоен; имею доверенность ко благости всевышнего и спокоен."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b338faee-5fe6-4cf7-a012-a3477f83c676",
                                "sense_id": "7822af6d-fc8a-3b08-9973-3fe5e125eba9",
                                "text": "Не оставь также этих детей твоих надолго в пустыне: дай им войти в разумение и вкусить то блаженство, какое я теперь по твоей благости ощущаю в моём духе."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fe5c48c2-8920-4cb0-b3b1-cf5f3ca2c197",
                                "sense_id": "7822af6d-fc8a-3b08-9973-3fe5e125eba9",
                                "text": "Но, по неизречённой благости своей, светлейший приказал мне представлять при тебе его особу, чтобы тебе был всюду заслуженный почёт."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b5d72e98-4c99-4683-a8f6-c720c9e20638",
                                "sense_id": "7822af6d-fc8a-3b08-9973-3fe5e125eba9",
                                "text": "Мир полон благости, какую ощущаешь зимой, слыша как разносится в морозном воздухе звон колоколов."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "dd4a5850-a3e8-36d1-a26a-cb89cc193db2",
                        "entry_id": "c82dd0aa-6ae1-316c-8c82-293f3f4530ab",
                        "glosses": [
                            "ощущение, впечатление чего-либо приятного, доброго, светлого"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "5cf740a9-12ce-41c3-9bf9-db0b53cc8ff4",
                                "sense_id": "dd4a5850-a3e8-36d1-a26a-cb89cc193db2",
                                "text": "И только эта благость по телу разлилась, как услышал Иван Денисович гул…"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "32d287ce-b603-4f4b-a304-55ab8df9fce2",
                                "sense_id": "dd4a5850-a3e8-36d1-a26a-cb89cc193db2",
                                "text": "Здесь его душа отдыхала, впитывая привычную с детских лет благость, которую источали эти медноствольные сосны, кустистые заросли орешника, весело зеленевшие между ними нежнолистые берёзки."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a14ebfbf-10c4-470a-88c9-b4344b12106d",
                        "source_entry_id": "c82dd0aa-6ae1-316c-8c82-293f3f4530ab",
                        "target_lang_word": "gentleness",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "gentleness",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b63ce856-cbfd-385f-9d5d-f04db239bcb4",
                                        "entry_id": "a4ab9e27-34c2-3a79-a550-50513ad89726",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The state of being gentle."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "93a98d8c-0f14-413a-a88e-3ee5ca9b21fa",
                                                "sense_id": "b63ce856-cbfd-385f-9d5d-f04db239bcb4",
                                                "text": "[S]he [Sabrina, a water nymph] reviv'd, / And undervvent a quicke, immortall change / Made goddeſſe of the river; ſtill ſhe retaines / Her maiden gentleneſſe, […]",
                                                "translation": "Comus",
                                                "english": "Comus"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f2e19bb4-fd34-42e7-b61d-cec78593ff83",
                                                "sense_id": "b63ce856-cbfd-385f-9d5d-f04db239bcb4",
                                                "text": "Willie spends his bus money home playing a song to dance to on the jukebox in an effort to comfort Sam, and unlike Hally, who struck out at his old friend when his life began to go wrong, Sam does not pass down Hally's hatefulness, but instead treats Willie with the same gentleness he has shown toward him throughout the play."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "806ea58e-018d-4d62-b968-3fdbae095258",
                        "source_entry_id": "c82dd0aa-6ae1-316c-8c82-293f3f4530ab",
                        "target_lang_word": "kindness",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "kindness",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3dc852ab-1965-3f0d-99e7-dc282f54121d",
                                        "entry_id": "c96eba70-ee76-3630-a286-7398193bcd26",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The state of being kind."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "85b64ef6-5462-418a-8af6-4e71ad930cc9",
                                                "sense_id": "3dc852ab-1965-3f0d-99e7-dc282f54121d",
                                                "text": "Jamie's kindness is legendary, so much that people have taken advantage of her."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f9b2b7d7-ef5b-47b7-8b3a-7ef7986e4d5d",
                                                "sense_id": "3dc852ab-1965-3f0d-99e7-dc282f54121d",
                                                "text": "If attending to your childhood wounds and responding with kindness feels selfish, it is important to remember that compassion for oneself often makes people more compassionate to others, Lev said."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cde269c3-91d6-355d-9700-4cfbf1ad8036",
                                        "entry_id": "c96eba70-ee76-3630-a286-7398193bcd26",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An instance of kind or charitable behaviour."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c828946f-6ab7-4e60-84b3-67ae6975cb42",
                                                "sense_id": "cde269c3-91d6-355d-9700-4cfbf1ad8036",
                                                "text": "How can I thank you for your many kindnesses?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "891af2e3-a28b-4c81-bd15-09d0a1fe2f68",
                                                "sense_id": "cde269c3-91d6-355d-9700-4cfbf1ad8036",
                                                "text": "Do me a kindness and leave."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bb3885f8-fea5-4449-a2bf-a24340da0ca8",
                                                "sense_id": "cde269c3-91d6-355d-9700-4cfbf1ad8036",
                                                "text": "i'm going to turn a blind eye to this misdemeanour, out of the kindness of my heart."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f61e6fa4-502f-4f9e-8b88-d09025a0a72e",
                                                "sense_id": "cde269c3-91d6-355d-9700-4cfbf1ad8036",
                                                "text": "They are grateful for kindnesses that they may have received."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
